WEBVTT

00:07:59.558 --> 00:08:00.935
for two reasons.

00:08:01.685 --> 00:08:06.065
First, all 64 triplet codons
in natural cells

00:08:06.065 --> 00:08:08.984
are used for making natural proteins,

00:08:08.984 --> 00:08:13.280
and there are simply no codons available
to encode the synthesis of new polymers.

00:08:14.448 --> 00:08:17.952
Second, the natural
translational machinery

00:08:17.993 --> 00:08:20.829
specifically uses natural amino acids

00:08:20.871 --> 00:08:23.290
and simply can't use
the chemical building blocks

00:08:23.332 --> 00:08:25.376
required to make new polymers.

00:08:26.794 --> 00:08:31.006
However, a virus-resistant organism